            <description>&lt;img src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/img/top_hydro.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Featured image of post Hydroponie project&#34; /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;hydroponie-project&#34;&gt;Hydroponie project&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a hydroponic system made for a family member. We will compare the effectiveness of the two systems. This system is very simple, it is about an aquarium pump which recyrculates a solution of nutrients. 4 inch and 1/2 inch pvc pipes with the components and glue to join them together were used to build the system. A filter was put on the return to keep the water basin clean. The other components are irrigation fittings, elbow and black pipes.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In order to prevent leaks, a retention basin made with EDPM canvas has been added under the shelf.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/hydro1.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/hydro2.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/hydro3.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://olboi7.github.io/fantastic-waffle/img/hydro4.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;june-4-2021&#34;&gt;June 4, 2021&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;aa&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#